Description: Lattice CPLD firmware update over JTAG (NVIDIA ispvme)
 ispvme programs Lattice CPLDs from VME files over the Linux JTAG
 character device interface (OpenBMC Aspeed / OBMC_AST).
 .
 Sources originate from Lattice and are packaged from
 https://github.com/NVIDIA/ispvme.
